{"i":724,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Gus is the base and I owe him my life; breaking now would hurt my jury standing. Cole is my pact partner and also safe, so keep him. Leaving secures my spot; no need to risk the rope."}
